---
import story from '../../data/vgi-agent-story.json';
interface Props { compact?: boolean; }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="walkthrough-video not-prose">
  {!compact && <><p class="video-eyebrow">Watch the agent do the work</p><h2>A request. Generated source. Passing SQL.</h2></>}
  <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/vgi/agents/agent-build-poster.png" aria-label="Recorded Claude Code build: worker source and passing DuckDB tests">
    <source src="/vgi/agents/agent-build.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    <track kind="captions" src="/vgi/agents/agent-build.vtt" srclang="en" label="English" default />
    <p><a href="/vgi/agents/agent-build.mp4">Download the recorded build</a>.</p>
  </video>
  <figcaption>Edited replay of a real Claude Code session: actual generated source, tool calls, and results. Setup and dependency inspection are omitted. The CSV follow-on was verified afterward. Captioned; no audio required.</figcaption>
  <div class="video-links"><a href="/vgi/agent-build-recording/">Step through the build at your pace →</a><a href="/vgi/agents/build-transcript.txt">Read the selected tool transcript</a></div>
  <details><summary>Read the video captions</summary>{story.frames.map(frame => <p>{frame.caption}</p>)}</details>
</figure>
<style>
  .walkthrough-video { margin:0; color:var(--color-soil-900); }.video-eyebrow { font-size:.8rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--color-sun-700); margin:0 0 .65rem; }.walkthrough-video h2 { font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem); margin:0 0 1.4rem; line-height:1.3; }.walkthrough-video video { display:block; width:100%; max-width:1000px; aspect-ratio:1280/900; border-radius:.75rem; border:1px solid var(--color-soil-300); background:var(--color-rock-900); }.walkthrough-video figcaption, .walkthrough-video details { font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.7; margin-top:1rem; color:var(--color-soil-600); max-width:95ch; }.walkthrough-video summary { cursor:pointer; }.walkthrough-video details p { max-width:85ch; }.video-links { display:flex; gap:1.3rem; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:1rem 0; font-size:.8rem; }.video-links a { color:var(--color-field-700); text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:3px; }
</style>
